she was *this* big. I mean the reason

00:00:29.745 --> 00:00:32.995
her name is Buddi is because, when we first got her,

00:00:32.995 --> 00:00:35.745
we thought that she was a boy

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:38.975
and -uhh- we only learned later

00:00:39.575 --> 00:00:42.325
that -uhh- she was not -ha. And so basically

00:00:42.325 --> 00:00:45.485
we had already been calling her "buddy", so we changed the

00:00:45.485 --> 00:00:48.595
Buddy with a "y" to a Buddi with an "i".

00:00:48.775 --> 00:00:51.795
And so ,when I- when I was really growing up

00:00:51.795 --> 00:00:54.075
-like- ever since from Junior High to

00:00:54.955 --> 00:00:57.865
-like- now, Buddi was

00:00:57.865 --> 00:00:59.255
the sweetest dog

00:00:59.715 --> 00:01:02.795
-like- the goodest girl to ever exist.

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:05.825
And -you know- I-I've

00:01:05.825 --> 00:01:08.215
shed my tears I've talked to my family,

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:11.115
but was is even more heartbreaking about it is

00:01:11.835 --> 00:01:15.315
-like- I've been spam recording the past two weeks for

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:18.465
this trip that I was going to take tomorrow.

00:01:19.215 --> 00:01:21.985
I was going to drive all the way back to Cincinnati,

00:01:21.985 --> 00:01:25.175
