00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:04.235
I've had Chica for just about 2 years now;

00:02:04.235 --> 00:02:06.535
over 2 years now I've had Chica.

00:02:06.845 --> 00:02:10.045
And in those 2 years, from the very first day I got her,

00:02:10.045 --> 00:02:11.875
I wanted her to meet Buddi.

00:02:13.145 --> 00:02:15.405
And I didn't make that happen.

00:02:16.195 --> 00:02:19.115
And I know I can't blame myself an- and letting it

00:02:19.115 --> 00:02:21.805
eating me up inside, and I don't, I'm no-
 I'm not letting it -like-

00:02:21.805 --> 00:02:25.115
spiral me down into depression, but it got me thinking about

00:02:25.115 --> 00:02:28.465
-like- opportunities that just pass you by

00:02:28.805 --> 00:02:31.825
because you think it can wait. You know, I don't have a- I don't have a

00:02:31.825 --> 00:02:34.415
a big sweeping life lesson to learn about this;

00:02:34.415 --> 00:02:37.015
I don't have a -like- a big sweeping -like-change, I'm like "dah I learned

00:02:37.015 --> 00:02:39.705
this lesson so X on the channel is gonna change forever,

00:02:39.705 --> 00:02:42.705
and that's a Markiplier promise", it's -um-

