learn was that -you know-

00:02:48.145 --> 00:02:51.095
it's very easy to make excuses to...

00:02:52.275 --> 00:02:55.235
push back the things that are important, but seem

00:02:55.235 --> 00:02:58.515
like they can wait -you know- I remember so many times that

00:02:58.705 --> 00:03:02.145
