00:03:59.915 --> 00:04:00.915
You never know

00:04:01.655 --> 00:04:04.395
Like it could be tomorrow it could be a year from now.

00:04:04.625 --> 00:04:07.545
Like why take that risk. Tell the people who are

00:04:07.545 --> 00:04:09.445
